  "description": "Ride the Everyday. Explore the Unexpected.\nMeet the Cyrusher Path — your go-to step into efficient, comfortable electric riding. Designed for the city, built for more: this 750 W e-bike blends power, smart control and lifestyle comfort to help you ride more, connect with nature and family, and stay vital.\nWhy the Path stands out\n\n750 W brushless hub motor with 85 N·m torque – strong starts, confident climbs, and smooth urban cruising.\n\nDual-mode sensor: torque & cadence – switch between natural pedal feel and easy assist depending on your route.\n\n48 V 15 Ah Samsung battery – removable, cleanly integrated into the frame, offering up to ~60 mi range for longer rides.\n\nComfort-first geometry & features – upright handlebars, adjustable stem, ergonomic saddle, and front suspension fork ensure you ride relaxed and in control.\n\nCommuter-ready details included – full-coverage fenders, sturdy rear rack included, integrated lights and turn signals built into the design for safety and convenience.\n\nBuilt for Vitality, Growth & Connection\nWhether you’re commuting, exploring greenways, or riding side-by-side with a partner or family member, the Path empowers you to keep moving — keep feeling young at heart, keep discovering each day. It’s not just about getting from A to B: it’s about connecting with what matters.",
